  "YAYC is your modern YouTube client, to help with the organization of scheduled and viewed content, progress tracking, and more!": "YAYC 是您的现代 YouTube 客户端，旨在帮助您整理计划和已观看的内容、跟踪进度等！",
  "YAYC main view consist of a left pane with the bookmarks,\\na right pane with a youtube view, and a toolbar.\\nThe toolbar consists of the common web browser controls,\\nplus a button to add the current video to bookmarks, a button\\nto copy it to the clipboard, and a button to open Settings.": "YAYC 主视图由包含书签的左侧窗格、\\n包含 YouTube 视图的右侧窗格以及一个工具栏组成。\\n工具栏包含常用的 Web 浏览器控件，\\n此外还有一个将当前视频添加到书签的按钮、一个\\n复制到剪贴板的按钮，以及一个打开设置的按钮。",
